---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../../consts";
import DoubleBox from "../../components/DoubleBox.astro";
import BoxBanner from "../../components/BoxBanner.astro";
import BarNrm from "../../components/BarNrm.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Código de Ética y Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias" description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
    <BarNrm />
    <Header title={SITE_TITLE} />

    <main>
        <div class=" my-12 mx-auto max-w-[1080px]">
            <h1
                class="audiowide neon-verde text-center md:text-left pt-4 font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
            >
                Código de Ética y Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias
            </h1>
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
                <div class="sm:min-w-[calc(100%-400px)] lg:mr-10 roboto">
                <br>
<p>En cumplimiento de la legislación vigente, ponemos a disposición de nuestros radioescuchas los datos de contacto de los Defensores de las Audiencias designados por la Cámara Nacional de la Industria de Radio y Televisión (CIRT), quienes reciben y atienden quejas, observaciones y sugerencias relacionadas con nuestros contenidos y programación.</p>
<p>Lic. Eli Manuel Ramírez Villaseñor</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Lic. Fabiana Estrada Tena</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Domicilio: Av. Horacio 1013, Col. Polanco III Sección, Alcaldía Miguel Hidalgo, C.P. 11540, Ciudad de México.</p>
<p>Teléfono: 55 5726 9909</p>
<br>

<div class="download-list" aria-label="Documentos para descargar">
    <a
        class="download-item"
        href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/CODIGO%20DE%20ETICA%202026%20AFILIADOS%20%20CIRT%20-%20RADIO%20XHMM-FM%20(STC).pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
        <span class="download-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                <path d="M6 3.75h8l4 4v12.5H6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" />
                <path d="M14 3.75v4h4M9 12h6M9 15h6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" />
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="download-copy">
            <strong>Código de Ética</strong>
            <span>Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                <path d="M12 3.5v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M5 15.5v4h14v-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" />
            </svg>
        </span>
    </a>
    <a
        class="download-item"
        href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/Lineamientos%20Generales%20para%20la%20Proteccio%CC%81n%20de%20los%20Derechos%20de%20las%20Audiencias.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
        <span class="download-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                <path d="M6 3.75h8l4 4v12.5H6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" />
                <path d="M14 3.75v4h4M9 12h6M9 15h6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" />
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="download-copy">
            <strong>Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias</strong>
            <span>Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
                <path d="M12 3.5v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M5 15.5v4h14v-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" />
            </svg>
        </span>
    </a>
</div>
                </div>



            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
<Footer />


<style>
a {
    color: #60A5FA;
}

.contact-email {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.contact-address {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.mail-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.mail-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #60A5FA;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease;
}

.mail-action:hover {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    background: #eff6ff;
}

.mail-action:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

.download-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-top: 2rem;
}

.download-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #d5deea;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #1e293b;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, background-color 150ms ease;
}

.download-item:hover {
    border-color: #60A5FA;
    background: #f5f9ff;
}

.download-item:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

.download-file-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #fff;
}

.download-file-icon svg {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
}

.download-copy {
    display: grid;
    flex: 1;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 0;
    line-height: 1.35;
}

.download-copy strong {
    color: #1e293b;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.download-copy > span {
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.download-arrow {
    display: grid;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #1e293b;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, color 150ms ease;
}

.download-arrow svg {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
}

.download-item:hover .download-arrow {
    border-color: #2563eb;
    color: #2563eb;
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .download-item {
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .download-file-icon {
        width: 2.75rem;
        height: 2.75rem;
    }

    .download-copy strong {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
}

</style>